evaluation/evaluation_results*.json
evaluation/tier2_multirun*.json
evaluation/innovation_analysis*.json
evaluation/multi_eval_*.json
# Example/stale research-question copies in ModelTeam dirs (research_questions.json is a kept input)
*/ael/*/example_research_questions_simple.json
